# Homebrew is the escape hatch for command-line tools that must update faster
# than the NixOS release does. Everything else is in the Nix config (see
# "Homebrew" in README.md). Before adding a tool here, check that Nix's
# version really is too old to use.
#
# Applied only when you run `brew-update` ([b] in the `update` menu): it
# shows missing and outdated formulas, and installed ones not listed here,
# then installs, upgrades and uninstalls to match this file if you say yes.
# After editing: commit, `rebuild`, then `brew-update`.

brew "yt-dlp"      # breaks when video sites change; fixes ship within days
